Icon artwork notice
-------------------
Most glyphs in this pack are derived from Arcticons
(https://github.com/Arcticons-Team/Arcticons), Copyright (C) Donno and
Arcticons contributors, licensed under GPL-3.0.

Modifications made by CEDAR: glyphs are recoloured from black to CEDAR sage
(#7BA88A), stroke weight is normalised to 1.25 (48x48 grid), and each glyph is
composited onto CEDAR's chamfered forest plate (#1A231D) with a dim-sage
hairline. The originals remain available at the URL above.

The CEDAR-original glyphs (cedar, strata, fieldstation, trailwatch, weather,
vault, notes, tasks) were drawn for this project and are licensed under the
same GPL-3.0 terms.

